### @Date: 2026-05-27 22:26 W3文档+文件夹+回收站+标签 全部测试通过
###
### W3 文档 + 文件夹 + 回收站测试
### 覆盖接口：
###   文件夹: 创建 / 列表 / 重命名 / 移动 / 删除
###   文档:   上传 / 列表 / 重命名 / 移动 / 下载 / 软删除
###   回收站: 列表 / 恢复 / 彻底删除
###
### 角色：OWNER(上传者) / ADMIN / MEMBER(助手上传)
### 权限规则：
###   - 空间成员可上传/查列表/下载
###   - 改/删/恢复/彻底删除 只能操作自己的，OWNER/ADMIN 可操作所有人的
###
### 第一次运行从注册开始；后续可从"登录"段开始

### =================== 1. 注册测试用户 ===================

### 注册 OWNER（上传者）
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "w3_owner",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 注册 MEMBER（另一个用户，用于测试操作他人的资源）
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "w3_member",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### =================== 2. 登录获取 Token ===================

### 登录 OWNER → token_owner
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "w3_owner",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token_owner", response.body.data);
    client.global.set("owner_user_id", 0);
    client.log("owner_token = " + response.body.data);
%}

###

### 登录 MEMBER → token_member
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "w3_member",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token_member", response.body.data);
%}

###

### 获取 OWNER 信息（拿 userId）
GET http://localhost:8080/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

> {%
    client.global.set("owner_user_id", response.body.data.userId);
    client.log("owner_user_id = " + response.body.data.userId);
%}

###

### 获取 MEMBER 信息（拿 userId）
GET http://localhost:8080/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

> {%
    client.global.set("member_user_id", response.body.data.userId);
    client.log("member_user_id = " + response.body.data.userId);
%}

###

### =================== 3. 初始化测试空间 ===================

### OWNER 创建空间
POST http://localhost:8080/space
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "name": "W3测试空间",
  "description": "文档和文件夹功能测试"
}

###

### 拿到 space_id
GET http://localhost:8080/space/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

> {%
    const spaces = response.body.data;
    const target = spaces.find(s => s.name === "W3测试空间");
    client.global.set("space_id", target.id);
    client.log("space_id = " + target.id);
%}

###

### OWNER 邀请 MEMBER 加入空间
POST http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}/members
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "username": "w3_member",
  "role": "MEMBER"
}

###

### =================== 4. 文件夹 CRUD ===================

### 4.1 [正] OWNER 创建根目录文件夹 "测试文件夹A"
POST http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/folders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "name": "测试文件夹A"
}

###

### 4.2 [正] OWNER 在文件夹A下创建子文件夹 "子文件夹B"
### 需要先拿到 folderA 的 id（从列表里找）
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/folders?parentId=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

> {%
    const folders = response.body.data;
    const folderA = folders.find(f => f.name === "测试文件夹A");
    client.global.set("folderA_id", folderA.id);
    client.log("folderA_id = " + folderA.id);
%}

###

### 创建子文件夹B
POST http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/folders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "name": "子文件夹B",
  "parentId": "{{folderA_id}}"
}

###

### 拿到子文件夹B的id
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/folders?parentId={{folderA_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

> {%
    const folders = response.body.data;
    const folderB = folders.find(f => f.name === "子文件夹B");
    client.global.set("folderB_id", folderB.id);
    client.log("folderB_id = " + folderB.id);
%}

###

### 4.3 [正] OWNER 重命名文件夹A → "文件夹A-已改名"
PUT http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/folders/{{folderA_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "newName": "文件夹A-已改名"
}

###

### 4.4 [反] MEMBER 重命名 OWNER 创建的文件夹 → 预期 "没有权限操作该资源"
PUT http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/folders/{{folderA_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

{
  "newName": "MEMBER非法改名"
}

###

### 4.5 [正] OWNER 把子文件夹B 移到根目录
PUT http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/folders/{{folderB_id}}/move
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "targetParentId": 0
}

###

### 验证子文件夹B已到根目录
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/folders?parentId=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###

### 把子文件夹B移回文件夹A
PUT http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/folders/{{folderB_id}}/move
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "targetParentId": {{folderA_id}}
}

###

### 4.6 [反] 不能把文件夹移到自己下面
PUT http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/folders/{{folderA_id}}/move
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "targetParentId": {{folderA_id}}
}

###

### 4.7 [反] 不能移到不存在的文件夹
PUT http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/folders/{{folderB_id}}/move
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "targetParentId": 999999
}

###

### =================== 5. 文档上传 ===================

### 5.1 [正] OWNER 上传文件到根目录
POST http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="folderId"

0
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"

hello world, this is a test file.
--boundary--

###

### 5.2 [正] OWNER 上传文件到文件夹A
POST http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="folderId"

{{folderA_id}}
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="doc_in_folderA.txt"

this file is in folder A.
--boundary--

###

### 5.3 [正] MEMBER 上传文件到根目录（用于后续测试别人的资源操作）
POST http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="folderId"

0
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="member_file.txt"

uploaded by member.
--boundary--

###

### 5.4 [反] 空文件名 → 预期 "文件名不能为空"
###（需要在前端测，后端通过 Content-Disposition 拿 filename）

###

### =================== 6. 文档列表 ===================

### 6.1 [正] 查看根目录文档列表
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents?folderId=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

> {%
    const docs = response.body.data;
    const ownerDoc = docs.find(d => d.name === "test.txt");
    const memberDoc = docs.find(d => d.name === "member_file.txt");
    client.global.set("doc_test_id", ownerDoc ? ownerDoc.id : null);
    client.global.set("doc_member_id", memberDoc ? memberDoc.id : null);
    client.log("doc_test_id = " + client.global.get("doc_test_id"));
    client.log("doc_member_id = " + client.global.get("doc_member_id"));
%}

###

### 6.2 [正] 查看文件夹A下的文档列表
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents?folderId={{folderA_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

> {%
    const docs = response.body.data;
    const docA = docs.find(d => d.name === "doc_in_folderA.txt");
    client.global.set("doc_folderA_id", docA ? docA.id : null);
    client.log("doc_folderA_id = " + client.global.get("doc_folderA_id"));
%}

###

