Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "newName": "test-renamed.txt"
}

###

### 7.2 [反] MEMBER 重命名 OWNER 的文档 → 预期 "没有权限操作该资源"
PUT http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{doc_test_id}}/rename
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

{
  "newName": "illegal rename"
}

