PUT http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{doc_test_id}}/move
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "targetFolderId": 0
}

###

### 8.3 [反] 移到不存在的文件夹 → 预期 "目标文件夹不存在"
PUT http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{doc_test_id}}/move
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "targetFolderId": 999999
}

