### =================== 10. 文档软删除（进回收站） ===================

### 10.1 [正] OWNER 删除自己的文档 → 预期 success（进入回收站）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{doc_test_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###

### 10.2 [反] MEMBER 删除 OWNER 的文档 → 预期 "没有权限操作该资源"
DELETE http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{doc_folderA_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

###

### 10.3 [正] MEMBER 删除自己的文档 → 预期 success
DELETE http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{doc_member_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

###

### =================== 11. 回收站列表 ===================

### 11.1 [正] 查看回收站 → 预期看到 test-renamed.txt 和 member_file.txt
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/trash
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

> {%
    const trashDocs = response.body.data;
    const restoredDoc = trashDocs.find(d => d.name === "test-renamed.txt");
    const memberDeleted = trashDocs.find(d => d.name === "member_file.txt");
    client.global.set("trash_doc_id", restoredDoc ? restoredDoc.id : null);
    client.global.set("trash_member_id", memberDeleted ? memberDeleted.id : null);
    client.log("trash_doc_id = " + client.global.get("trash_doc_id"));
    client.log("trash_member_id = " + client.global.get("trash_member_id"));
%}

###

### 11.2 [正] MEMBER 也能看到回收站列表
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/trash
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

###

### =================== 12. 恢复文档 ===================

### 12.1 [反] MEMBER 恢复 OWNER 的文档 → 预期 "没有权限操作该资源"
PUT http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{trash_doc_id}}/restore
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

###

### 12.2 [正] OWNER 恢复自己的文档（不传 targetFolderId，恢复原位）
PUT http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{trash_doc_id}}/restore
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{}

###

### 验证：文档已恢复到根目录列表
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents?folderId=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###

### 12.3 [正] MEMBER 恢复自己的文档
PUT http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{trash_member_id}}/restore
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

{}

###

### 验证：MEMBER 的文档已恢复
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents?folderId=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

###

### =================== 13. 彻底删除 ===================

### 13.1 先把文档再次软删除（为彻底删除测试准备）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{doc_test_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###

DELETE http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{doc_member_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

###

### 刷新 trash id
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/trash
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

> {%
    const trashDocs = response.body.data;
    const restoredDoc = trashDocs.find(d => d.name === "test-renamed.txt");
    const memberDeleted = trashDocs.find(d => d.name === "member_file.txt");
    client.global.set("trash_doc_id", restoredDoc ? restoredDoc.id : null);
    client.global.set("trash_member_id", memberDeleted ? memberDeleted.id : null);
%}

###

### 13.2 [反] OWNER 彻底删除不存在的文档 → 预期 "文件不存在"
DELETE http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/999999/purge
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###

### 13.3 [正] OWNER 彻底删除自己的文档
DELETE http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{trash_doc_id}}/purge
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###

### 验证：回收站不再有这个文档
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/trash
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###

### =================== 14. 删除文件夹（级联） ===================

### 14.1 先创建一个待删文件夹及其子文档
POST http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/folders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "name": "待删除文件夹"
}

###

### 拿待删除文件夹的 id
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/folders?parentId=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

> {%
    const folders = response.body.data;
    const target = folders.find(f => f.name === "待删除文件夹");
    client.global.set("del_folder_id", target ? target.id : null);
    client.log("del_folder_id = " + client.global.get("del_folder_id"));
%}

###

### 上传文件到待删除文件夹
POST http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="folderId"

{{del_folder_id}}
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="will_be_deleted.txt"

this file will be soft-deleted with the folder.
--boundary--

###

### 14.2 [反] MEMBER 删除 OWNER 的文件夹 → 预期 "没有权限操作该资源"
DELETE http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/folders/{{del_folder_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

###

### 14.3 [正] OWNER 删除文件夹 → 文件夹硬删，文件夹内文档软删
DELETE http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/folders/{{del_folder_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###

### 验证：文档被软删（进回收站）
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/trash
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###

### =================== 15. 恢复文档到指定文件夹 ===================

### 15.1 原文件夹已不存在，传 targetFolderId 恢复到文件夹A
###（拿 trash 列表里刚被级联删除的文档 id）
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/trash
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

> {%
    const trashDocs = response.body.data;
    if (trashDocs.length > 0) {
        const lastDoc = trashDocs[trashDocs.length - 1];
        client.global.set("cascade_doc_id", lastDoc.id);
        client.log("cascade_doc_id = " + lastDoc.id + " name = " + lastDoc.name);
    }
%}

###

### 15.2 [反] 恢复时不传 targetFolderId → 预期 "原文件夹已经被删除"
PUT http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{cascade_doc_id}}/restore
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{}

###

### 15.3 [正] 传 targetFolderId 恢复到文件夹A
PUT http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{cascade_doc_id}}/restore
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "targetFolderId": {{folderA_id}}
}

###

### 验证：文档已恢复到文件夹A
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents?folderId={{folderA_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###

### =================== 16. 标签功能测试 ===================

### 16.0 前置准备：上传测试文档（之前的 doc 已在之前步骤中删除/恢复）
### OWNER 上传一个文档
POST http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="folderId"

0
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="tag_test_doc.txt"

this doc is for tag testing.
--boundary--

###

### 拿到新上传文档的 id
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents?folderId=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

> {%
    const docs = response.body.data;
    const target = docs.find(d => d.name === "tag_test_doc.txt");
    client.global.set("tag_doc_id", target ? target.id : null);
    client.log("tag_doc_id = " + client.global.get("tag_doc_id"));
%}

###

### MEMBER 也上传一个文档
POST http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="folderId"

0
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="member_tag_doc.txt"

member doc for tag testing.
--boundary--

###

### 拿到 MEMBER 文档的 id
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents?folderId=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

> {%
    const docs = response.body.data;
    const target = docs.find(d => d.name === "member_tag_doc.txt");
    client.global.set("member_tag_doc_id", target ? target.id : null);
    client.log("member_tag_doc_id = " + client.global.get("member_tag_doc_id"));
%}

###

### 16.1 [反] MEMBER 创建标签 → 预期 "您没有权限操作该空间"
POST http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/tags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

{
  "name": "MEMBER非法标签"
}

###

### 16.2 [正] OWNER 创建标签 "重要"
POST http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/tags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "name": "重要"
}

###

### 16.3 [正] OWNER 创建标签 "待审核"
POST http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/tags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "name": "待审核"
}

###

### 16.4 [正] 获取标签列表，拿到 "重要" 和 "待审核" 的 id
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

> {%
    const tags = response.body.data;
    const important = tags.find(t => t.name === "重要");
    const pending = tags.find(t => t.name === "待审核");
    client.global.set("tag_important_id", important ? important.id : null);
    client.global.set("tag_pending_id", pending ? pending.id : null);
    client.log("tag_important_id = " + client.global.get("tag_important_id"));
    client.log("tag_pending_id = " + client.global.get("tag_pending_id"));
%}

###

### 16.5 [正] OWNER 重命名标签 "待审核" → "已审核"
PUT http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/tags/{{tag_pending_id}}?newName=已审核
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###

### 16.6 [反] MEMBER 重命名标签 → 预期 "您没有权限操作该空间"
PUT http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/tags/{{tag_important_id}}?newName=非法改名
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

###

### 16.7 [正] OWNER 给文档 tag_test_doc.txt 打标签 "重要"
POST http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{tag_doc_id}}/tags/{{tag_important_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###

### 16.8 [正] OWNER 给同一文档打标签 "已审核"
POST http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{tag_doc_id}}/tags/{{tag_pending_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###

### 16.9 [反] MEMBER 给 OWNER 的文档打标签 → 预期 "没有权限操作该资源"
POST http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{tag_doc_id}}/tags/{{tag_important_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

###

### 16.10 [正] MEMBER 给自己的文档打标签 "重要"
POST http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{member_tag_doc_id}}/tags/{{tag_important_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

###

### 验证：标签已打上（可以通过列表接口验证，后续搜索阶段再做）
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###

### 16.11 [反] MEMBER 摘 OWNER 文档的标签 → 预期 "没有权限操作该资源"
DELETE http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{tag_doc_id}}/tags/{{tag_important_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

###

### 16.12 [正] OWNER 摘自己文档的标签 "重要"
DELETE http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/documents/{{tag_doc_id}}/tags/{{tag_important_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###

### 16.13 [反] MEMBER 删除标签 → 预期 "您没有权限操作该空间"
DELETE http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/tags/{{tag_important_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

###

### 16.14 [正] OWNER 删除标签 "重要"
DELETE http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/tags/{{tag_important_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###

### 验证：标签列表不再有 "重要"
GET http://localhost:8080/spaces/{{space_id}}/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###
